# The image is built from this directory, and the Dockerfile copies src/ whole.
# Without this, a local `docker build` bakes the gitignored Gemini key in
# src/main/resources/application-secrets.properties into the jar, and anyone
# who pulls the image can read it. Production builds from git, which never
# has the file, so this only bites local builds -- which is why it is easy to miss.
**/application-secrets.properties
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Build output and local scratch: never needed, and they bloat the context.
target/
*.pdf
HELP.md

# Editors and OS noise.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
